  <!-- PTK-7465 Servo Specifications:                                     -->
  <!--   Stall Torque: 5.5 kg·cm = 0.5394 N·m                            -->
  <!--   No-Load Speed: 0.075 s/60° = 13.96 rad/s                        -->
